<title>ITALY: BX-ITALY-STET-ATT.</title>
<headline>BX-ITALY-STET-ATT.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian telecom group Stet and U.S. giant AT&amp;T might sign a cooperation deal this week, the undersecretary at the post and telecommunications ministry, Michele Lauria, said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe that the deal will be formulised imminently,&quot; Lauria told Reuters.</p>
</text>
